// Platform marks drawn in the result pills in place of the emoji in lib/constants.js: every mark
// the web's PlatformIcon draws (SIMPLE_ICON_PATHS in apps/web/src/components/PlatformIcon.tsx),
// Subvert's being the logo it sent us (api/shared/platform-logos.ts). Copies, because the extension
// can't import from apps/ or api/; platform-logo-copies.test.ts keeps each path and fill rule
// identical. currentColor, so a mark takes the pill's text colour. The platforms with no mark
